}
--- hint
Each of the three lines in `render()` compares `state.view` with the name of one view: `homeView.hidden = state.view !== "home";`. The other two work the same way.
--- hint
```js
function render() {
  homeView.hidden = state.view !== "home";
  showView.hidden = state.view !== "show";
  myListView.hidden = state.view !== "mylist";
  ...
```
```js
function openShow(id) {
  state.view = "show";
  render();
  window.scrollTo(0, 0);
}
```
In `createCard`: `card.addEventListener("click", () => { openShow(show.id); });`
